WEBVTT

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:36.650
When I open my photo book, I see different sides of me. {purichou...}

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:39.420
Laughing, {warattari}

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:42.200
or playing it cool, in all the pictures. {sumashitari de...}

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:44.930
I don't wanna say, "what's with all these characters?" But... {nani kore...}

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:47.640
Isn't this too much fun? {arisugi...}

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:50.220
For real? {maji...}

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:52.430
I mean, thanks! {tte yuu ka...}

00:00:53.010 --> 00:00:55.760
Even if I lose my way,  {maigo ni...}

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:58.370
my heart's egg {kokoro no...}

00:00:58.370 --> 00:01:01.140
will be all right. Come back {daijoubu...}

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:03.830
to me! {modotteoide}

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:06.610
Hey, when we're together... {kimi to...}

00:01:06.610 --> 00:01:09.330
Hop, step, jump!

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:11.940
Because you're here... {kimi ga...}

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:14.590
Drew, draw, drawn!

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:17.460
I'm always with you...  {kimi to...}

00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:20.180
Chip, syrup, whip!

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:22.860
One more time,  {mou ichido...}

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:25.470
unlock my heart! {kokoro...}

00:01:25.470 --> 00:01:28.240
I love you.  {daisuki yo}

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:30.700
All of you.  {minna}

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:33.590
I want to be next to you. {soba ni...}

00:01:33.590 --> 00:01:35.900
Okay? {ne...}

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:37.050
Love ya! {suki yo}

00:01:46.660 --> 00:01:48.100
Amu-chan.

00:01:49.660 --> 00:01:50.950
Amu-chan.

00:01:54.980 --> 00:01:56.180
Dia.

00:02:00.990 --> 00:02:02.260
The Embryo?

00:02:02.650 --> 00:02:06.970
That's right. It's a magical egg that can grant any wish.

00:02:06.970 --> 00:02:09.720
So, what do you wish for?

00:02:10.110 --> 00:02:12.220
What do you want, Amu-chan?

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:15.860
I wish...

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:23.140
What is it, Amu-chan?

00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:25.120
What are you doing?

00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:31.790
It was all just a dream.

00:02:32.600 --> 00:02:37.610
Episode 51
Grab the Embryo!

00:02:37.820 --> 00:02:41.120
Oh? So you had a dream about Dia, Amu-chan?

00:02:41.120 --> 00:02:43.180
Yeah, and the Embryo was in it, too.

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:45.940
So what did you wish for, Amu-chan?

00:02:46.340 --> 00:02:47.580
Well...

00:02:47.580 --> 00:02:48.810
I am sure it was...

00:02:51.180 --> 00:02:55.750
That she would get married to Tadase-kun, right?

00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:58.190
But I was sure it'd be...

00:02:58.190 --> 00:03:00.580
Look at that, it's mega-cute! I've gotta have it!

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:02.450
Please, Lord Embryo!

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:03.390
That.

00:03:03.390 --> 00:03:05.760
No, it wasn't!

00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:09.160
If I could have any wish granted, I'd want lots of friends.

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:10.890
Or to see Nadeshiko again.

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:13.430
Or maybe the best choice would be world peace?

00:03:13.430 --> 00:03:16.870
Ah, but I really want a raise in my allowance,

00:03:16.870 --> 00:03:18.220
There's more?

00:03:16.910 --> 00:03:21.310
and to learn things after only studying them once, and...

00:03:18.220 --> 00:03:19.330
So greedy.

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:21.320
That's our Amu-chan.

00:03:25.110 --> 00:03:27.640
My wish...

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:30.480
Huh? We've still got places to go?

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:33.450
I already told you I want to check out one more store!

00:03:33.450 --> 00:03:35.560
Will you stop using me as your servant already?

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:37.230
Not a chance.

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:38.930
Then at least take one of these bags.

00:03:38.130 --> 00:03:41.020
What a shock. Sensei's on a date.

00:03:38.930 --> 00:03:41.530
No way. Isn't that a man's job?

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:42.310
A date?

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:45.470
She forced me to come with her on my day off!

00:03:45.470 --> 00:03:46.620
That's ludicrous!

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:49.550
Who'd date this lazy, good-for-nothing loser of a man?

00:03:49.550 --> 00:03:50.720
You've got to be kidding!

00:03:51.890 --> 00:03:53.600
Hey, Su's here.

00:03:53.890 --> 00:03:55.860
Can I help you?

00:03:55.860 --> 00:03:58.310
Oh, it's nothing important.

00:03:58.310 --> 00:03:59.350
Just tell us!

00:04:00.530 --> 00:04:04.680
Actually, I got an interesting e-mail this morning.

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:09.890
I think one of my former coworkers at Easter sent it to me by accident.

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:13.890
Director, the Embryo will definitely appear tonight!

00:04:13.890 --> 00:04:15.920
There can be no mistake!

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:17.440
The Embryo?

00:04:18.380 --> 00:04:22.690
They're still struggling to give the Boss the Embryo, it seems.

00:04:22.690 --> 00:04:24.370
Who is this "Boss" person?

00:04:24.370 --> 00:04:27.010
Ikuto's mentioned him before. Who exactly is he?

00:04:28.680 --> 00:04:30.330
Actually...

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:31.640
Actually?

00:04:32.320 --> 00:04:34.100
We don't know either!

00:04:34.100 --> 00:04:34.770
Hey!

00:04:35.550 --> 00:04:37.940
The Director's the only one who's met him.

00:04:37.940 --> 00:04:41.140
All employees must follow the Boss's orders, without exception.

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:43.650
Even Tsukiyomi Ikuto-kun.

00:04:44.060 --> 00:04:45.640
Ikuto.

00:04:45.640 --> 00:04:47.770
You should feel honored.

00:04:47.770 --> 00:04:52.100
No other, save myself, has ever met the Boss before.

00:05:10.520 --> 00:05:14.190
As you wished, I have come to report.

00:05:14.190 --> 00:05:17.010
Tonight, we shall commence our secret operation.

00:05:17.010 --> 00:05:22.330
The completed machine should scoop out a large number of X Eggs from children.

00:05:22.330 --> 00:05:29.010
Tsukiyomi Ikuto, who is also present, will be useful in capturing the Embryo tonight as well.

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:31.200
I have high expectations.

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:32.000
Of course, Sir.

00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:35.500
So after all that, he doesn't show his face?

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:38.520
You should be more mindful of that mouth. {check me?}

00:05:38.840 --> 00:05:44.180
Your fate is to obey both he and I absolutely, after all.

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:56.110
Tonight, at the least, we must neutralize this girl.

00:05:56.110 --> 00:05:57.950
Hinamori Amu.

00:05:57.950 --> 00:06:03.350
You're always appearing where you shouldn't, and cleansing the X Eggs.

00:06:03.350 --> 00:06:05.890
Man, they piss me off.

00:06:05.890 --> 00:06:07.930
Everyone at Easter does-nya!

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:09.530
Right, Ikuto?

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:11.680
Yeah.

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:15.840
And so, let's have a toast to start the Embryo welcoming party!

00:06:15.840 --> 00:06:17.310
Cheers!

00:06:19.680 --> 00:06:22.060
Welcome! Embryo-chan

00:06:23.560 --> 00:06:26.530
Why are you guys doing all this?

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:30.190
Because the Embryo might show up tonight.

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:32.430
It's kind of like a stake-out or something.

00:06:32.430 --> 00:06:37.570
But we don't know if Sensei's information is true or not, and Easter might be up to something.

00:06:37.570 --> 00:06:41.000
If Easter shows up, my Sky Jack...

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:42.840
And my Dear Baby...

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:44.000
Will knock them silly!

00:06:44.020 --> 00:06:47.510
Be quiet! Less partying and more canvassing!

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:48.520
Why aren't you taking this seriously?

00:06:49.930 --> 00:06:54.820
But if the Embryo really does appear and Easter tries something,

00:06:54.820 --> 00:06:57.470
I'm sure we can still get it as long as we work together.

00:06:57.470 --> 00:06:58.440
Yeah!

00:06:58.440 --> 00:07:01.070
Man, I'm psyched!

00:07:01.070 --> 00:07:04.940
I've already thought about the wish I want the Embryo to grant!

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:06.220
It'll be...

00:07:06.220 --> 00:07:08.560
All-you-can-eat sweets!

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:12.510
And after that, to be a baby character forever!

00:07:12.510 --> 00:07:15.860
With maybe just a touch of an older sister character, too.

00:07:15.860 --> 00:07:17.130
That's contradictory.

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:20.630
Haven't you decided, Rima?

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:23.450
I only have one wish.

00:07:23.450 --> 00:07:26.590
I wish for a strong heart to overcome my own weaknesses.

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:29.390
I want to become a true leader.

00:07:29.390 --> 00:07:30.510
Indeed.

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:32.970
I'm pretty satisfied with myself right now,

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:35.430
so I'd like to say I don't have anything to wish for.

00:07:35.950 --> 00:07:38.100
But I wanna do something really big!

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:41.930
Something people will say makes an impact-bam-on the world!

00:07:41.930 --> 00:07:42.480
Yeah!

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:44.180
What about you, Rima-tan?

00:07:51.180 --> 00:07:52.350
That's a secret.

00:07:52.690 --> 00:07:54.580
Huh? You little weenie. {she uses a very cute non-word here based on "kechi"}

00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:56.490
It's a secret, a secret!

00:07:56.490 --> 00:07:59.420
Man, just tell me already!

00:07:59.420 --> 00:08:02.040
She said it's a secret.

00:08:05.030 --> 00:08:07.250
Amu-chan, you've got mail!

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:14.220
I have information for you. Come to that place no one else knows about. Ikuto.

00:08:14.490 --> 00:08:15.570
Ikuto?

00:08:15.570 --> 00:08:16.630
What's this?

00:08:16.630 --> 00:08:19.190
It has to be something important!

00:08:19.190 --> 00:08:20.600
It's suspicious.

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:22.530
What is it, Amu-chi?

00:08:22.530 --> 00:08:24.180
Sorry, something's come up.

00:08:24.180 --> 00:08:25.630
I'll be back soon.

00:08:28.490 --> 00:08:31.440
What is it? I'm really curious.

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:33.400
But what did he mean by "that place?"

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:34.720
It's probably over there.

00:08:41.220 --> 00:08:44.330
It's quite desolate now, isn't it?

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:46.650
It hasn't been used since that other time.

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:54.810
Brings back memories, don't you think?

00:08:56.350 --> 00:08:59.020
I wonder where Ikuto is.

00:08:59.020 --> 00:09:00.930
Amu-chan, look over there.

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:11.540
Wow!

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:13.230
I didn't know this place existed.

00:09:13.230 --> 00:09:14.630
It's so lovely.

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:20.890
Ikuto?

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:25.240
It's locked!

00:09:26.930 --> 00:09:29.120
That guy isn't Ikuto!

00:09:29.120 --> 00:09:31.560
He's a fake! We've been tricked, Amu-chan!

00:09:35.110 --> 00:09:36.850
What is this?

00:09:43.550 --> 00:09:44.860
Ran!

00:09:44.860 --> 00:09:46.580
Are you okay?

00:09:46.580 --> 00:09:47.880
Hang in there!

00:09:47.880 --> 00:09:50.380
Raim-ryokay...

00:09:52.680 --> 00:09:54.360
What should we do?

00:09:56.540 --> 00:09:58.650
Amu is late.

00:09:59.080 --> 00:10:00.420
I wonder what happened.

00:10:00.420 --> 00:10:02.380
Everyone, look at that!

00:10:05.140 --> 00:10:07.230
What the heck are those?

00:10:07.230 --> 00:10:08.450
UFOs?

00:10:08.450 --> 00:10:10.970
Wow, what a scoop!

00:10:11.910 --> 00:10:13.220
Those are...

00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:19.110
The Embryons are operating normally!

00:10:19.110 --> 00:10:22.100
Okay! Commence the X Egg harvesting plan!

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:23.450
Roger!

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:32.770
We did it!

00:10:35.880 --> 00:10:37.580
What'll we do?

00:10:50.640 --> 00:10:53.940
The number you have dialed cannot be connected at this time.

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:55.800
It's no use, it won't connect.

00:10:55.800 --> 00:10:59.290
Amu-chan, if we Character Transform, we might be able to do something.

00:10:59.290 --> 00:11:00.370
But...

00:11:00.370 --> 00:11:02.050
What's the matter?

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:05.220
I left the Humpty Lock at school!

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:07.210
What were you thinking?!

00:11:07.210 --> 00:11:08.660
You're a failure as a heroine!

00:11:08.660 --> 00:11:10.720
What a klutz you are, Amu-chan!

00:11:09.890 --> 00:11:10.740
I'm sorry.

00:11:11.260 --> 00:11:14.470
But what'll we do now? We might be in real trouble here.

00:11:17.810 --> 00:11:22.120
Will those things really call out the Embryo?

00:11:22.120 --> 00:11:26.220
Chief, everything went as planned. Hinamori Amu will not be a problem.

00:11:26.220 --> 00:11:29.790
I'm glad I used Tsukiyomi Ikuto's name to lure her out.

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:32.020
It was a success-

00:11:32.020 --> 00:11:33.830
A success?

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:35.110
Yes?

00:11:35.110 --> 00:11:36.060
Hello?

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:38.970
What did you do to Amu?

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:46.770
Those are...

00:11:46.770 --> 00:11:49.470
I can sense the presence of X Eggs inside the UFOs!

00:11:49.770 --> 00:11:51.270
It's Easter, as we suspected!

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:53.260
They're coming this way!

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:58.830
Amu-chan, if Easter is behind this, then...

00:11:58.830 --> 00:12:03.000
Yeah. The story about the Embryo appearing might actually be true.

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:06.600
But if we don't get out of here first...

00:12:11.600 --> 00:12:12.990
Slash Claw!

00:12:14.520 --> 00:12:15.890
Ikuto!

00:12:16.160 --> 00:12:19.250
Why'd you let yourself get trapped so easily, idiot?

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:19.680
Id-

00:12:19.680 --> 00:12:21.860
Never mind! You're late!

00:12:21.860 --> 00:12:24.970
If you were gonna come, you should've done it sooner!

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:31.000
Oh? I was going to tell you something interesting, but I think I've changed my mind.

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:31.680
What?

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:43.410
What's going on?

00:12:43.410 --> 00:12:46.230
That's not in their programming!

00:12:49.140 --> 00:12:51.860
The X Eggs aren't listening to us!

00:12:51.860 --> 00:12:54.520
They're reversing the energy flow, and we can't control them!

00:12:54.520 --> 00:12:55.640
What?!

00:12:58.350 --> 00:12:59.740
What's happening?

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:00.930
Are they fighting each other?

00:13:07.270 --> 00:13:09.530
I have a bad feeling about this-dechu.

00:13:09.530 --> 00:13:11.130
A bad feeling!

00:13:17.780 --> 00:13:20.820
What is this? Why won't they listen to us?

00:13:20.820 --> 00:13:22.510
What are you doing?

00:13:23.180 --> 00:13:26.150
Aren't you supposed to be collecting X Eggs?

00:13:27.770 --> 00:13:29.250
I'll interpret!

00:13:29.250 --> 00:13:32.100
We're currently investigating how to stop them, however...

00:13:34.860 --> 00:13:37.220
It might be impossible.

00:13:42.270 --> 00:13:44.410
No, my snacks!

00:13:44.410 --> 00:13:45.460
Hey!

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:48.980
Oh, who even cares?

00:13:48.980 --> 00:13:50.460
She lost her will to act!

00:13:54.300 --> 00:13:57.010
No, my afternoon snack.

00:13:54.630 --> 00:13:55.960
At this rate...

00:13:55.960 --> 00:13:57.010
Everyone!

00:13:57.010 --> 00:13:57.700
Amu!

00:13:57.700 --> 00:13:59.420
Sorry I'm late!

00:13:59.420 --> 00:14:00.720
Let's go, Ran!

00:14:00.720 --> 00:14:01.680
Okay!

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:06.220
My heart:

00:14:06.220 --> 00:14:06.970
Unlock!

00:14:45.450 --> 00:14:47.980
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:14:57.660 --> 00:14:59.110
Us, too!

00:14:59.110 --> 00:14:59.930
Right.

00:15:00.430 --> 00:15:02.470
Me, too!

00:15:03.480 --> 00:15:04.820
My heart:

00:15:04.820 --> 00:15:06.050
My heart:

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:07.310
My heart:

00:15:07.310 --> 00:15:08.640
My heart:

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:09.970
Unlock!

00:15:11.320 --> 00:15:13.140
Come on, Pepe-chan!

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:14.930
Right-dechu!

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:46.500
Character Transformation: Platinum Royal!

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:49.560
Character Transformation: Clown Drop!

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:53.220
Character Transformation: Dear Baby!

00:15:56.060 --> 00:15:58.960
Character Transformation: Sky Jack!

00:15:59.660 --> 00:16:00.890
All of us together make...

00:16:02.470 --> 00:16:04.690
Guardian 5!

00:16:05.360 --> 00:16:07.300
Wait, what heck was that?

00:16:07.300 --> 00:16:08.870
I've just always wanted to say that!

00:16:15.210 --> 00:16:17.690
Let's go!

00:16:20.890 --> 00:16:24.680
Golden Victory Shoot!

00:16:26.390 --> 00:16:29.390
Juggling Party!

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:35.180
Me, too!

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:37.220
Go Go Little Duckies!

00:16:40.460 --> 00:16:42.430
Hinamori-san, now!

00:16:42.430 --> 00:16:43.180
Right!

00:16:45.950 --> 00:16:50.140
Spiral Heart Special!

00:16:54.100 --> 00:16:56.120
White Decoration!

00:17:06.810 --> 00:17:08.850
Negative Heart:

00:17:10.770 --> 00:17:11.880
Lock On!

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:17.020
Open Heart!

00:17:24.930 --> 00:17:26.410
It's over.

00:17:26.410 --> 00:17:27.430
All right!

00:17:39.750 --> 00:17:40.910
That's...

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:42.200
The Embryo!

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:43.470
It really appeared!

00:17:45.950 --> 00:17:48.220
That's the Embryo!

00:17:48.220 --> 00:17:49.520
Ikuto!

00:17:49.520 --> 00:17:50.020
Right.

00:17:55.850 --> 00:17:57.730
What?

00:17:57.730 --> 00:17:58.880
Ikuto-kun?

00:18:02.800 --> 00:18:03.960
Ikuto!

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:06.890
Hinamori-san?

00:18:14.410 --> 00:18:15.680
Hinamori-san.

00:18:15.680 --> 00:18:17.390
Amu-chan.

00:18:23.190 --> 00:18:24.740
The Embryo!

00:18:30.160 --> 00:18:31.540
I'm sure

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:34.100
it'll grant everyone's wishes.

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:37.970
My wish

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:39.020
as well.

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:42.440
What is your true wish, Amu-chan?

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:45.860
Amu, I'll be the one to take it!

00:18:52.050 --> 00:18:54.390
What does Ikuto wish for?

00:18:54.650 --> 00:18:58.310
What does he want?

00:18:59.560 --> 00:19:01.310
What in blazes are you doing?

00:19:01.310 --> 00:19:02.730
Explain yourselves!

00:19:02.730 --> 00:19:03.870
Director!

00:19:03.350 --> 00:19:04.840
DANGER

00:19:03.870 --> 00:19:04.840
Oopsie.

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:07.660
The flare!

00:19:09.640 --> 00:19:11.270
Hinamori-san!

00:19:16.850 --> 00:19:18.220
Ikuto!

00:19:34.430 --> 00:19:35.730
Holy Crown!

00:19:39.560 --> 00:19:42.100
Yikes, just barely made it.

00:19:47.260 --> 00:19:48.650
Tadase-kun.

00:19:52.660 --> 00:19:54.280
Tsukiyomi Ikuto!

00:19:54.280 --> 00:19:55.560
I won't hand it over to you!

00:19:55.880 --> 00:19:58.310
I won't hand <i>anything</i> over to you!

00:20:03.440 --> 00:20:04.250
Amu!

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:05.310
Amu-chi!

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:08.770
I'm glad you're okay!

00:20:08.770 --> 00:20:09.930
Amu-chan!

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:11.170
Are you all right?

00:20:11.170 --> 00:20:11.810
Yeah.

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:14.550
What happened to the Embryo?

00:20:14.550 --> 00:20:16.420
It flew off somewhere.

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:19.310
I'm sorry, I...

00:20:19.600 --> 00:20:21.210
Why are you apologizing?

00:20:21.210 --> 00:20:22.690
It's not like you, Amu.

00:20:22.690 --> 00:20:25.350
I'm glad you're safe, Hinamori-san.

00:20:25.350 --> 00:20:26.770
That's all that matters right now.

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:34.950
Man, and we were so close-nya.

00:20:34.950 --> 00:20:36.810
We'll find it again.

00:20:54.300 --> 00:20:58.100
Darn it, we were so close to the Embryo.

00:20:58.100 --> 00:20:59.020
Yeah, we sure were.

00:20:59.350 --> 00:21:01.500
What a shame.

00:21:01.500 --> 00:21:04.400
But you know what I think?

00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:07.420
I still have a ways to go.

00:21:07.420 --> 00:21:12.310
I still don't know what I really wish for, or who I want to be.

00:21:13.240 --> 00:21:20.050
That's okay! That just means a lot of fun things are still waiting for us, things we don't even know about!

00:21:20.050 --> 00:21:21.500
Like meeting different people!

00:21:21.500 --> 00:21:22.920
And great adventures!

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:25.170
So much excitement!

00:21:25.170 --> 00:21:27.280
I guess so.

00:21:27.280 --> 00:21:28.450
It's true!

00:21:28.450 --> 00:21:32.530
Because we believe in your radiance, Amu-chan.

00:21:42.910 --> 00:21:44.770
And once again

00:21:44.770 --> 00:21:46.970
a tale begins to spin anew. {if you edit this, keep "to spin a tale" in those words}

00:21:53.950 --> 00:21:56.270
Sorry to make you wait.

00:21:56.270 --> 00:21:57.850
I was running a bit late.

00:21:58.200 --> 00:22:00.970
You are totally late, Amu-chi! Not just a little!

00:22:01.460 --> 00:22:03.920
Good morning, Hinamori-san.

00:22:03.920 --> 00:22:05.920
Good morning, Amu.

00:22:06.600 --> 00:22:08.720
Good morning, everyone.

00:22:10.910 --> 00:22:14.330
All of the children searching for their true selves

00:22:15.050 --> 00:22:17.650
step forth to meet their new fates.

00:22:35.760 --> 00:22:42.730
There's no limit to the dreams we wild things can see.  {abarenbou...}

00:22:42.730 --> 00:22:43.870
(Yeah, yeah, yeah.)

00:22:43.870 --> 00:22:47.080
If we're born with 100% possibilities,  {kanouseo...}

00:22:47.080 --> 00:22:50.030
then let's keep livin' at 100%. {hyakupa...}

00:22:50.500 --> 00:22:54.870
Let's cry and laugh, {naritari...}

00:22:54.870 --> 00:22:58.490
and meet all kinds of people.  {ironna...}

00:22:58.490 --> 00:23:02.030
Let's discover what's precious, {daiji na}

00:23:02.030 --> 00:23:05.040
and even lose it. {nakushitari}

00:23:05.040 --> 00:23:05.790
(But don't worry.) {hai donmai...}

00:23:05.790 --> 00:23:09.410
We've just gotta keep on runnin', {gan gan...}

00:23:09.410 --> 00:23:12.200
because that way's the most fun, you see.  {sono hou...}

00:23:12.200 --> 00:23:13.120
(Right on, right on.)

00:23:13.120 --> 00:23:16.560
I wanna do this, and I wanna do that too. {are mo shitai...}

00:23:16.560 --> 00:23:17.500
Let's go!  (Go!!)  {iku...}

00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:18.540
Move out! (Yeah!!) {susu...}

00:23:18.540 --> 00:23:20.780
Let's do it with gusto! {gachinko de ...}

00:23:20.780 --> 00:23:27.410
Because there's only one you in this world, {sekai ni...}

00:23:27.410 --> 00:23:34.570
you've gotta make sure you find the things you love. {daisuki...}

00:23:50.100 --> 00:23:53.860
Man, in the end, we didn't capture the Embryo.

00:23:53.860 --> 00:23:56.390
Don't let it get you down.

00:23:56.390 --> 00:23:58.620
That's right. Remember what Tadase-kun said?

00:23:58.620 --> 00:24:01.600
"All that matters is that you are safe, Hinamori-san."

00:24:01.600 --> 00:24:03.630
That's some pretty significant progress there.

00:24:03.630 --> 00:24:05.710
Huh? You think?

00:24:05.710 --> 00:24:06.950
Yes, it is!

00:24:06.950 --> 00:24:10.400
Okay, then now's the time to completely rethink everything!

00:24:10.400 --> 00:24:12.290
Shugo Chara!! Doki!

00:24:12.290 --> 00:24:13.720
Sparkle With All Your Heart!

00:24:13.720 --> 00:24:15.620
Hey, what's with the "Doki?"

00:24:15.620 --> 00:24:16.360
Look forward...

00:24:16.360 --> 00:24:17.220
To it...

00:24:17.220 --> 00:24:18.930
Next time!
